	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"自分だけのファンタジージョブを創り出すことが出来る『30 MINUTES FANTASY』より、「30MF アイテムショップ2(ファイターオプション)」が登場！",
			"• “アーマークロス”［装甲換装］の幅を広げる武装やアイテムが詰まったセット。",
			"• 肩、胸アーマーのパーツに加え、2種類のフェイスパーツが付属。",
			"• 「ランス」と「ツインソード」が付属。ツインソードはジョイントパーツで接続可能。",
			"• 「木箱」と「木製ジョッキ」が付属。「木箱」は蓋を開閉可能。",
			"（※付属品の木箱、木製ジョッキは設定上の名称となります）"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"30 MINUTES FANTASY\", where you can create your own fantasy job, \"30MF ITEM SHOP 2 (FIGHTER OPTION)\" is now available!",
			"• A set full of weapons and items that expand the range of \"Armor Cross\" [Armor Modification].",
			"• In addition to shoulder and chest armor parts, two types of face parts are included.",
			"• \"Lance\" and \"Twin Swords\" are included. The twin swords can be connected with joint parts.",
			"• \"Wooden box\" and \"wooden mug\" are included. The lid of the \"wooden box\" can be opened and closed. (* The wooden box and wooden mug of accessories are the names on the setting)"
		]
	},
